<title>USA: Microfluidics seeks acquisition candidates.</title>
<headline>Microfluidics seeks acquisition candidates.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Mass. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microfluidics International Corp said on Thursday that it had hired corporate finance firm O'Conor, Wright Wyman Inc to help the company identify potential acquisition candidates.</p>
<p>Microfluidics said in a statement that it had no debt and some $3.2 million in cash and that it was seeking acquisitions &quot;that are complementary to the company's materials processing equipment business.&quot;</p>
</text>
